    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luk kɛ kui̱ Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mɛmɛ ɛ ruac ëë ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ lat kɛ kui̱ Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn, kɛnɛ kui̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n ji̱ Kɛ̈l-da-ya kɛ thok go̱kä ni Yir-mɛ-yaa, wëë i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kɛ ɣöö ci do̱r ben pek kuec caam mi bi jɛ mak, min bi mundɛ jak kä doth baaŋ, kä bɛ thil ram mi bi cieŋ thi̱n. Kä bi ji̱kɛ kɛnɛ leykɛ rɔ̱ bar rɛydɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kɛ kɛn ni̱n tɔ̱tɔ̱, kɛ jɛn gua̱a̱th ɛmɔ, cu Kuoth Nhial ruac ɛn ɣöö, bi ji̱ thukni duëli kuec caam kɛnɛ ji̱ Juda ben kɛɛl, kä bikɛ ja̱l kɛ wiee min bäkɛ. Kä bi kɛn Kuoth Nhial ni Kuothdiɛn go̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi kɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p in wä kä Dha-yɔn thiec, kä bikɛ wä thi̱n, kä bikɛ wee i̱, ‘Bia, la̱tnɛ mat ruac mi ci bi met thuuk kä ca bi pa̱l ruëëc kɛ Kuoth Nhial.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ci nɛɛkä cu ce̱tnikɛ ti ci bath. Kä ci yiëënkiɛn kɛ cu buath jɔ̱ɔ̱r, a wä kɛ yi̱ec ni wuɔ̱thni päämni. Ci kɛn wä yi̱ec wuɔ̱thni päämni kɛnɛ rët, cikɛ luakdiɛn cu pa̱l ruëëc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä tin diaal tin jek kɛ cakɛ cam, kä lar ji̱ tɛ̈riɛn jɛ i̱, ‘Thilɛ kɔ duer, kɛ ɣöö ci kɛn duer lät kä Kuoth Nhial in la yieendiɛn in thuɔ̱k, Kuoth in ŋääth gua̱ndɔɔŋnikiɛn ɛ.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bar ɛ rɔ̱ raar däär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn, kä wiaa raar muun ji̱ Kɛ̈l-da-ya, kä jakɛ rɔ̱ kä ce̱tkɛ tut deet böwni nhiam deet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö, nɛnɛ ɣän jiɛ̈cä döör ti ŋuan kɛnɛ wi̱i̱ ti di̱t, ti bi ben nyiëëny kɛ Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn, kä bi kɛ ben wi̱i̱ni kuec caam. Kä bikɛ a ji̱ tɛ̈rɛ ti di̱t, kä bikɛ jɛ käp. Kä ce̱t kui̱n kui̱ndiɛn nikɛ wut köör mi ŋäc ca̱a̱p köör kä /ci luny jɔk a ken raan näk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ji̱ Kɛ̈l-da-ya ba kɛ pɛc, kä ba ram mi pɛɛc jɛ jakä jek ŋɔak thi̱n,” ruac ni Kuoth Nhial.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä ca I-thɛ-rɛl kak ce̱tnikɛ det tin la da̱kɛ piny ɛ lony. Kä ci kuäär A-thi-ri-ya kɛ däk ni jio̱l, kä täämɛ ci Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn kɛ lɛ ɣɔak piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ, cu Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa ni Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl wee i̱, ‘Nɛ̈nɛ jɛ, ɣän nöŋä kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn kɛnɛ mundɛ da̱k, mi ce̱tnikɛ da̱k ëë cä lät kä A-thi-ri-ya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän bä I-thɛ-rɛl nyɔk kɛ luc ta̱a̱dɛ kä, bɛ mi̱eth jek kä Kar-mɛl kɛnɛ Ba-can, kä ba tin diaal tin go̱o̱rɛ jak kä ro̱ŋ pääm Ɛ-pa-rim kɛnɛ Gil-yad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn ni̱ni tɔ̱tɔ̱ ɛn guäth ɛmɔ, cu Kuoth Nhial ɛ lar ɛn ɣöö ba dueer I-thɛ-rɛl go̱r, kä thilɛ mi bi jek, kä ba dueer Juda go̱r, kä thilɛ mi ba jek. Kɛ ɣöö ɣän bä nɛy tëë ci kään pälikä.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Liɛŋɛ nɛy tin ci rɔ̱ bar, tin ci rɔ̱ lëny muun Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn, lat kɛn ɛ rɛy Dha-yɔn ɛn ɣöö ci Kuoth Nhial ni Kuothdan rɔ col. Cɛ col kɛ kui̱ nɛɛnikɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Cɔalɛ ji̱ kuen kueeni kɛ ɣöö ba Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn mak, kɛn nɛy tin ka̱pkɛ bääri kɛn diaal tin ŋa̱ckɛ la̱t bäärä, kuɛ̈ɛ̈ pua̱t gölɛ jɛ, a jɛ thil ram kɛl mi kac. La̱tdɛ jɛ ce̱tnikɛ lätkɛ, a jɛ la̱tkɛ, kä jɛ ce̱tkɛ pek lätnikɛ. Kɛ ɣöö lätdɛ ni liak kɛ kui̱ Kuɔth Nhial ni Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ, ba ŋuɛ̈tnikɛ diaal näk rɛy duɔ̱pnikɛ, kä ba rɛmdɛ ni kɛɛliw nor ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ,” ruac ni ɣän Kuoth Nhial.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä cu Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa mɛmɛ lat ɛn ɣöö ca ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ciɛŋ a jiäk, kä ca ji̱ Juda ciɛŋ a jiäk kɛɛl kɛ kɛ. Ci nɛy tëë naŋ kɛ kɛ ala pɛ̈ɛ̈c kɛ yian piny ɛ bum, kä pën kɛ kɛ wä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä lueeliɛn bumɛ, kä cɔalkɛ ciötdɛ i̱ Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa. Ɛ puc bɛ ruacdiɛn ka̱mkɛ kɛ ɣöö dɔ̱ŋ bɛ wi̱c muɔ̱ɔ̱n moc lɔ̱a̱ŋ, kuɛ la ɣöö, /ci ji̱ Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn bi tekɛ lɔ̱a̱ŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ, bi cieŋ ni ley dɔaar kɛnɛ ya̱a̱k rɛy Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn, kä bi wuɔ̱t cieŋ thi̱n bä. Kä /cɛ bilɛ tekɛ raan amäni cäŋ kɛl, kä /ca jɛ bi nyɔk kɛ ciëŋ ɛ raan bëëri diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
