          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bɛ ce̱tnikɛ mëë ci Kuoth Thɔ-dɔm kɛnɛ Go-mo-ra kɛ wi̱i̱ ji̱ thieekädiɛn däk, ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ lar ɛn ɣöö /ci raan bi lɛ cieŋ thi̱n. Thilɛ gat ran mi bi rɔ nyɔk kɛ ja̱l thi̱n.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.40"
            ]
          }
        }
